      needed: ['Diagram Z is the one with the ventricles contracting', 'Justification from the diagram: arrows show blood flowing up/out of the ventricles into the arteries (out of the heart)', 'Valve evidence: semilunar valves open AND AV valves closed (or ventricle volume reduced)'],
