    source: 'LC Irish syllabus — An Léamhthuiscint (Ceist Ghramadaí/Teanga); SEC Irish HL marking scheme 2024 — Ceist 6(a) \'Aimsigh sampla de bhriathar sa Mhodh Coinníollach\' (3 mharc: 2+1) (p.24; same task also in HL 2021 & 2022); na briathra neamhrialta fall under the Cruinneas strand of Cumas Gaeilge',
