      needed: ['One sentence with a correct Modh Coinníollach form (Déarfainn / Ba bhreá liom / Mholfainn / Dá mbeadh)', 'One sentence with a proverb or idiom (nath cainte / seanfhocal) used naturally', 'The idiom introduced smoothly (e.g. \'Mar a deir an seanfhocal...\') rather than dropped in randomly', 'Both sentences accurate - séimhiú/urú/verb form correct (a wrong conditional becomes an error, not richness)'],
